.TH DROIDSHIELD 1 "October 2026" "DroidShield 0.2.0" "DroidShield Manual"
.SH NAME
droidshield \- defensive Android malware triage and incident-response toolkit
.SH SYNOPSIS
.B droidshield
.I command
.RI [ options ]
.SH DESCRIPTION
DroidShield collects evidence from authorized Android devices over ADB,
performs package and APK triage, produces forensic reports, and provides
guarded remediation workflows. Analysis is defensive and read-only by default.
.SH COMMANDS
.TP
.B devices
List connected Android devices.
.TP
.B capabilities
Show locally available analysis tools.
.TP
.B scan
Run a read-only device security scan.
.TP
.B apk
Inspect an APK without executing it.
.TP
.B package-apk
Acquire and analyze an installed package APK.
.TP
.B yara
Run an explicit YARA ruleset against a file.
.TP
.B case
Create a forensic incident-response case bundle.
.TP
.B case-verify
Verify a case evidence manifest.
.TP
.B remediate
Perform guarded package disable, restore, or uninstall operations.
.TP
.B windows
Show Windows host/tooling status.
.TP
.B gui
Launch the Windows desktop interface.
.SH SAFETY
Only assess devices you own or are authorized to assess. A heuristic risk score
is not proof of malware. Review evidence before remediation.
.SH SEE ALSO
.BR adb (1)
